      "text": "x now holds four byte counts: b3 b2 b1 b0 = 2, 3, 4, 4.\nMultiplying by 0x01010101 adds four shifted copies of x:\nx + (x << 8) + (x << 16) + (x << 24). The top byte ends up\nholding b3 + b2 + b1 + b0. The total is at most 32, which\nfits easily in a byte, so no carry can corrupt it; anything\npushed past bit 31 is simply dropped. >> 24 then moves the\ntop byte down: that is the return value.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "x now holds four byte counts: b3 b2 b1 b0 = 2, 3, 4, 4.\nMultiplying by 0x01010101 adds four shifted copies of x:\nx + (x << 8) + (x << 16) + (x << 24). The top byte ends up\nholding b3 + b2 + b1 + b0. The total is at most 32, which\nfits easily in a byte, so no carry can corrupt it; anything\npushed past bit 31 is simply dropped. >> 24 then moves the\ntop byte down: that is the return value.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-0223",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1344,
      "y": 1566.5,
      "width": 393.72,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-0219"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1179868187,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 106997655,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790467200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  x * 0x01010101         0x0D0B0804\n  >> 24                  0x0000000D   = 13",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  x * 0x01010101         0x0D0B0804\n  >> 24                  0x0000000D   = 13",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rect-0225",
